{"id":"0d69d246a306b245","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-prop-rank.md","title":"Rank Properties","display":"prop-rank — Rank Properties","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-rank","aliases":["58-prop-rank"],"display":"prop-rank — Rank Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch10/58-df-rank.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-rank"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-rank</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-rank — Rank Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"39b5d097687ec105\" href=\"?note=39b5d097687ec105\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-rank.md\">../batch10/58-df-rank.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"39b5d097687ec105\" href=\"?note=39b5d097687ec105\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-rank.md\">../batch10/58-df-rank.md</a>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rank} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(X)=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)\\}:y\\in X\\}\\land\n\\forall y\\in X\\;(\\operatorname{rank}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{rank}(X))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rank} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(X)=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)\\}:y\\in X\\}\\land\n\\forall y\\in X\\;(\\operatorname{rank}(y)&lt;\\operatorname{rank}(X))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The rank of a set is the supremum of the successor ranks <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rank}(y)+1\">\\(\\operatorname{rank}(y)+1\\)</span> of its members; it need not equal <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y):y\\in X\\}+1\">\\(\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y):y\\in X\\}+1\\)</span> for limit-rank sets.</li>\n<li>Sets have well-defined ranks by recursion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-rank.md","status":"resolved","id":"39b5d097687ec105","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-rank.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-rank.md","status":"resolved","id":"39b5d097687ec105","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in V$ and $\\operatorname{rank}:V\\to V$ (see [[../batch10/58-df-rank.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}:V\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rank} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{rank}(X)=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)\\cup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y)\\}:y\\in X\\}\\land\n\\forall y\\in X\\;(\\operatorname{rank}(y)<\\operatorname{rank}(X))","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rank}(y)+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup\\{\\operatorname{rank}(y):y\\in X\\}+1","display":false}],"bytes":790,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3988","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-prop-rank.md|58-prop-rank]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["39b5d097687ec105"]}